 "note": "Curvy, 10 platforms, 3 relays. The middle is a figure eight: an X junction on the axis and on each side a loop round the home's middle platform - a Curve_90 over, a Curve_90 under. The middle platforms are swings (rotation) between the upper and the lower loop; the top axis platform (over Curve_45 arches) is a remote console for the X's upper decks. Bridges: S pockets, S / M / L, Curve_45, Curve_90, X. (Map Lab W-08)",
